cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite the manuscript and the archived
  release. The analysis code is MIT-licensed; derived data and figures are
  CC BY 4.0.
type: software
title: >-
  Separating mixing from selection: a leave-one-line-out benchmark and an
  audit protocol for cross-cell-line perturbation evaluation
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived per-target scores for a leave-one-line-out
  benchmark of cross-cell-line perturbation prediction, covering four
  harmonized cell lines (Tier A) and five heterogeneous lines (Tier B),
  together with metric and pool controls and an independent H1 truth-table
  confirmation.
